Files in eval_data/, used by evalscope's scicode_verified benchmark. Keep them byte-identical to upstream.

eval_data/13.6.txt, eval_data/62.1.txt, eval_data/76.3.txt: reference implementations of the three SciCode steps that the official harness never
generates nor scores (it injects this code so that later steps build on it). Copied unchanged from
https://github.com/scicode-bench/SciCode/tree/main/eval/data (Apache License 2.0), as used by the SciCode-Verified
harness (https://github.com/flyingwagner/scicode-verified, eval_clean/run_deepseek_eval.py, SKIP set).

eval_data/background_comment_template.txt, eval_data/multistep_template.txt: the official SciCode prompt
templates (without / with scientist background), copied unchanged from
https://github.com/scicode-bench/SciCode/tree/main/eval/data (Apache License 2.0), byte-identical to the copies
vendored by SciCode-Verified (eval_clean/vendor/eval_data, md5 3a376df5... / 5de36afe...).
